 on and keep the dialogue engaging. Expect a table filled with pastries\, f
 ruit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your choice of entrée and gene
 rous sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas available throughout.\n\nIt’s
  a fresh\, convivial take on brunch at The ’House—effortless\, engagin
 g\, and just the right amount of serendipitous.\n\n*Tickets are $65 per pe
 rson\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 
