SUMMARY:Women\, Worth & Wisdom: The Younger Generation
LOCATION:Bondo
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: $35.00 per person\nAvailability:
  52 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse
 .com/events/182099\n\n11:30AM Lunch\, 12:00PM Discussion \n\nJoin us for 
 the final installment of our four-part series\, Women\, Worth & Wisdom\, l
 ed by Colette Phillips\, founder of Get Konnected. This ongoing series bri
 ngs together influential women from across industries to share perspective
 \, lived experience\, and the enduring impact of women supporting one anot
 her.\n\nThis session will explore the importance of elevating the next gen
 eration—creating space\, offering guidance\, and fostering opportunities
  for emerging female leaders and innovators. Through thoughtful conversati
 on and shared insight\, the discussion will consider how we can continue t
 o bring more women to the table and support their growth in meaningful way
 s.\n\nEngaging and open in spirit\, the afternoon invites connection\, ref
 lection\, and dialogue among peers.\n\n*This event is offered at $35 per p
 erson\, plus tax\, to account for the buffet lunch\, enjoyed during the pr
 ogram. Reservations are open to members\, plus one guest. Cancellations ma
 de within 48 hours of the event are subject to a full charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182099
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
