 lable\nTime: 7 PM – 10 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/e
 vents/182285\n\nEnd the evening with a nightcap in the Reading Room this M
 other’s Day weekend\, where The ’Quin’s pastry team presents an imag
 inative dessert trolley inspired by the beauty of the season in bloom. Eac
 h confection is artfully crafted in the form of a flower\, offering a deli
 cate balance of flavor and design.\n\nThoughtfully composed and visually s
 triking\, this offering is designed to delight the senses and linger long 
