 in good company with the Café Q Community dinner table for members-only. 
 Set aside for those looking to expand their social circle over a shared me
 al\, this gathering is all about good food\, lively conversation\, and mea
 ningful connections. Pull up a chair\, and savor the experience—because 
 nothing brings people together quite like a great meal.\n\n*This event is 
 reserved for members only. An advance charge of $24 per member contributes
  to communal appetizers available upon seating. Members are responsible fo
 r à la carte entrées\, desserts\, and beverages\, plus taxes and fees. C
 ancellations made within 24 hours of the event\, or failure to attend will
  be subject to the Café Q's surcharge policy.
